{
    "pr_body": "This stops the `BlockHash`es from emitting empty pages when the batch size and number of results from a page lines up. It doesn't hurt the aggs, but it was making testing more complex than we'd like.\r\n\r\nCloses #112443\r\nCloses #112442\r\n",
